    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Elemental Adventure</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fire is stuck in trouble, they caught his friend lightning and now he has to find him from the evil tech element. With the aim of destroying the earth inhabited by all elements.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overcome the obstacles and kill the slimes and get all the energys balls you find to get score and finish with the slime boss</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There are 3 biomes for now, but soon we will add more levels about snow and jungle</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space: Jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Left</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D: Right</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click: shot</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits to:\u00a0GWriterStudio (for the 8 bits music)</h2>",
